      "country_notes": {
        "TWN": "Combined official 2006/2007 follow-up sample corrected severe initial lower-grade undercoverage and met sampling standards. Translation/adaptation issues remain noted. School response and overall exclusion numbers for the combined sample are absent from Tables 11.1-11.3; do not fabricate them. OECD Technical Report PDF pp.188 and 282 (printed 280).",
        "ESP": "Absent pupils miscoded as ineligible; approximate response adjustments. Official adjudication says population coverage cannot be estimated correctly, though substantial bias was not expected. Numeric table values retain this qualification.",
        "USA": "Reading invalid because of printing error; mathematics/science retained, estimated effect about one point. School nonresponse analysis accepted.",
        "QAT": "Booklet pagination deviations and extensive missing parental occupations; blank tests treated as nonresponse.",
        "IRL": "Longer test-session breaks in about one-third of sessions.",
        "CAN": "High exclusions; official adjudication retained results.",
        "HKG": "Initial school response below target; official nonresponse evaluation accepted results.",
        "SWE": "Language-related exclusions and one mistranslated item removed.",
        "NOR": "Language-related exclusions; some test administrators were teachers."
      },
